        "pane.step2": ["en":"Paste with ⌘V, right-click → Paste, or Paste editable drawing in this panel, including a new unsaved document. Save your Office document whenever you choose.","zh":"按⌘V、右键选择“粘贴”，或点击此面板中的“粘贴可编辑绘图”。新建且尚未保存的文档也可使用。Office文档由你按需要保存。"],
