        "pane.troubleshooting": ["en":"Installation and troubleshooting","zh":"安装与故障排查"],
        "pane.setupHelp": ["en":"Open ChemDraw Add-in for Mac from Applications or its menu bar icon. Choose “Add-in Setup” to view permissions and automatically configure the local editing helper.","zh":"从“应用程序”或菜单栏图标打开ChemDraw Add-in for Mac。选择“设置加载项”，查看授权并自动配置本地编辑助手。"],
        "pane.activationHelp": ["en":"Find the entry under Home → Add-ins → Developer Add-ins → ChemDraw Add-in for Mac. Once activated, the ChemDraw Add-in for Mac ribbon tab also opens it.","zh":"在“开始 → 加载项 → 开发人员加载项 → ChemDraw Add-in for Mac”中激活。激活后也可从ChemDraw Add-in for Mac功能区选项卡打开。"],
        "pane.officeHelp": ["en":"Use your existing Office installation. Open the blue C entry inside each app to activate the panel. If an automated check labels the entry disabled, confirm it with an actual foreground click.","zh":"使用已安装的Office。在每个应用中点击蓝色C图标以激活面板。若自动检查显示入口被禁用，请在Office前台实际点击确认。"],
        "pane.repairHelp": ["en":"If the panel will not load, open the configuration window and choose “Repair Add-in”. A fresh installation also needs the Mac to trust the local localhost certificate.","zh":"若面板无法加载，请打开设置窗口并选择“修复加载项”。首次安装时还需按提示信任本地连接证书。"],
        "pane.previewHelp": ["en":"This local preview automatically selects the newest installed ChemDraw and needs the desktop Office applications. It creates managed SVG drawings with full editable source.","zh":"本地预览自动选择已安装的最新ChemDraw，并使用Office桌面应用。生成的SVG绘图包含完整的可编辑源数据。"],
