        "system.automation": ["en":"ChemDraw Add-in for Mac controls ChemDraw, Word, PowerPoint and Excel to edit chemical drawings locally and write them back to your document.","zh":"ChemDraw Add-in for Mac控制ChemDraw、Word、PowerPoint和Excel，在本机编辑化学结构并回写到文档。"],
        "installer.welcome.0": ["en":"ChemDraw Add-in for Mac","zh":"ChemDraw Add-in for Mac"],
        "installer.welcome.1": ["en":"Version 1.5.2 · Apple Silicon + Intel · macOS 12 or later","zh":"版本1.5.2 · Apple Silicon + Intel · macOS 12或更新"],
        "installer.welcome.2": ["en":"Update the application icon, banner, menu-bar icon and Office panel artwork.","zh":"更新应用图标、横幅和菜单栏图标，Office面板同步使用新标识。"],
        "installer.welcome.3": ["en":"Choose Check for Updates and confirm to download, replace and reopen the app automatically.","zh":"升级时选择“检查更新”，确认后自动下载、替换并重新打开应用。"],
        "installer.welcome.4": ["en":"Add-in Setup opens automatically after installation. Allow Office file access when prompted, then complete the five checks to start using the app.","zh":"安装后自动打开“设置加载项”，按系统提示允许Office文件访问，完成五项检查后即可使用。"],
        "installer.welcome.5": ["en":"Existing drawings, connection certificates, and recovery drafts are retained. When upgrading from an older version, confirm Accessibility and Automation access when prompted.","zh":"已有绘图、连接证书及恢复草稿继续保留。从旧版升级时，按系统提示确认辅助功能和自动化授权。"],
        "installer.welcome.6": ["en":"Finish editing and quit the app before upgrading.","zh":"升级前请完成当前编辑并退出应用。"],
        "installer.conclusion.0": ["en":"ChemDraw Add-in for Mac Installation Complete","zh":"完成ChemDraw Add-in for Mac安装"],
        "installer.conclusion.1": ["en":"The app will open Add-in Setup automatically to check Word file access, PowerPoint file access, Accessibility, and the paste helper.","zh":"应用将自动打开“设置加载项”，分别检查Word文件访问、PowerPoint文件访问、辅助功能和粘贴助手。"],
        "installer.conclusion.2": ["en":"Allow access to the Word, PowerPoint and Excel apps you use when prompted. The app will verify directory access and start the helper automatically. Click “Done” when all five checks pass.","zh":"请在系统提示中允许访问所用的Word／PowerPoint／Excel。程序会自动验证目录读写并启动助手，五项检查通过后点击“完成”。"],
        "installer.conclusion.3": ["en":"When upgrading from an older version, confirm Accessibility and Automation access when prompted.","zh":"从旧版升级时，按系统提示确认辅助功能和自动化授权。"],
        "installer.conclusion.4": ["en":"If file access is denied, click “Authorize File Access Again” or “Repair Add-in” in the main window. Allow access when prompted; setup will continue automatically.","zh":"文件访问被拒绝时，点击“重新授权文件访问”或主界面的“修复加载项”，按提示允许后程序会自动继续。"],
        "installer.conclusion.5": ["en":"For later upgrades, check for updates and confirm in the app.","zh":"后续升级在应用内检查更新并确认即可完成。"],
        "installer.conclusion.6": ["en":"Saving a structure keeps the ChemDraw editing window open. Save your Office document when you choose.","zh":"结构保存后，ChemDraw编辑窗口保持打开；Office文档由你决定何时保存。"],
